msgid ""
"<p>To open a project, select \"Open\" from the Project-menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>aan open 'n projek, kies \"open\" van die projek-menu.\n"

#: tips.cc:81
msgid ""
"<p>If you compile your project and get an error, you can click on the\n"
"error message to switch to the file and line the error occured.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>as jy kompileer jou projek en kry 'n fout, jy kan kliek op die\n"
"fout boodskap aan wissel aan die lêer en lyn die fout voorgekom.\n"

#: tips.cc:86
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can use keyboard shortcuts for turning the output and tree "
"window on and off ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"...wat jy kan gebruik sleutelbord kortpaaie vir skakel die uitset en boom "
"venster op en af ?\n"

#: tips.cc:90
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can debug your programs within KDevelop by selecting "
"\"Debug\" in the Build-menu or by choosing the Debug icon ?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cc:94
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can switch between classes by selecting the class combo in "
"the toolbar ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan wissel tussen klasse deur deur te kies die klas "
"gekombineerde in die nutsbalk ?\n"

#: tips.cc:98
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can edit xpm's with kiconedit by selecting them in the file "
"viewer's trees ?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cc:102
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can set the compiler warnings in the project options dialog "
"?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan stel die saamsteller waarskuwings in die projek opsies "
"dialoog ?\n"

#: tips.cc:106
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can even search for marked text even from within the\n"
"documentation browser with a right button menu ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan al soektog vir gemerkte teks al van binne in die\n"
"dokumentasie blaaier met 'n regterkant knoppie kieslys ?\n"

#: tips.cc:111
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can copy text from the documentation browser to the "
"clipboard\n"
"with a right button menu and insert it into your sources ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan kopie teks van die dokumentasie blaaier aan die klipbord\n"
"met 'n regterkant knoppie kieslys en voeg by dit binnein jou bronkodes ?\n"

#: tips.cc:116
msgid ""
"<p>...that you should keep your library documentations up to date after "
"installing new libraries ?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cc:120
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can configure the syntax-highlighting of the editor ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan konfigureer die syntax-highlighting van die redigeerder ?\n"

#: tips.cc:124
msgid ""
"<p>"
"...that you can undo and redo your actions and set the amount of steps in "
"the editor dialog ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herstel en herstel herroep jou aksies en stel die "
"hoeveelheid van stappe in die redigeerder dialoog ?\n"

#: tips.cc:128
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can access more internal debug functions by holding down the "
"debug toolbar button ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan toegang verkry meer intern ontfouting funksies deur hou "
"ondertoe die ontfouting nutsbalk knoppie ?\n"

#: tips.cc:132
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can move the cursor by words with Ctrl and left or right "
"arrow ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan beweeg die plekaanduier deur woorde met ctrl en links of "
"regterkant pyl ?\n"

#: tips.cc:136
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can bookmarks helpbrowser pages in the \"Bookmarks\" menu ?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cc:140
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can start grep search from inside editor and browser with "
"context menu ?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan begin grep soektog van binne in redigeerder en blaaier met "
"konteks kieslys ?\n"

